%!PS
/r { 0 0 3 -1 roll 1 rectfill } def
/p { 1 1 rectfill } def
/b { { 1 } { 0 } ifelse r } def
(*) { length r } 50 string /Generic resourceforall
/G1 1 /Generic defineresource pop /G22 2 /Generic defineresource pop
(G?) { length r } 50 string /Generic resourceforall
(G*) { length r } 50 string /Generic resourceforall
